      "text": "At ₹7,599 (NSE close, 16 Nov 2026), a discounted cash flow model with a 13.06% cost of capital does not reach the price at any revenue growth up to 30% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 21.1%; with revenue growing at its FY23–FY26 rate of 17.5%, it does at an operating margin of 47.6%.",
