      "text": "With the other assumptions at base, the valuation is most sensitive to the cost of capital (one percentage point either way: a model value of ₹3,245 to ₹4,139 a share) and to how long EICHERMOT keeps earning high returns on new investment (anywhere from returns equal to its cost of capital to a quarter above its past level: a model value of ₹3,029 to ₹3,665 a share); the Q3 FY27 result will be the next reported quarter.",
